 **Notes**: There are two ways to specify magnetic field.
 1. specify Bmagnitude, Btheta, Bphi
 2. specify Bx, By, Bz
 Bmagnitude, Bx, By, Bz are real numbers in unit of Tesla. and Bx, By, Bz 
 are in the cartesian coordinates. Btheta is the angle with z axial 
  and Bphi is the angle with respect to x axial in the x-y plane
  Btheta is in [0, 180], Bphi is in [0, 360).
 If you specify both of them together, we will choose the first one.
 If choose the first one, but not specify Btheta, Bphi, then 
 by default we set Btheta=0, Bphi=0 which means B is along z direction.
  
